# Grants the plugdev group control access to the VIA Labs VL812 USB2.0 hub
# (2109:2812) that the NUCLEO-F446RE's ST-LINK/V2.1 sits behind, so
# uhubctl can power-cycle that port without root. See
# infrastructure/core/usb_hub_power.py and infrastructure/udev/README.md.
SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTR{idVendor}=="2109", ATTR{idProduct}=="2812", MODE="0664", GROUP="plugdev"
